  "worked_solution": "We substitute $n=3$ and $n=5$ into the definition of the sequence:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{3} & =7-3(3)^{2}=-20 \\\\ {a}_{5} & =7-3(5)^{2}=-68\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the sum of the third and fifth terms is\n\n$$\n{a}_{3}+{a}_{5}=(-20)+(-68)=-88.\n$$",
